#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:107
#: 70bcb8973cda4e7098b0f22bee87762e
msgid ""
"Once you’ve obtained the QMSK, you must verify that it’s authentic rather "
"than a forgery. Anyone can create a PGP key with the name “Qubes Master "
"Signing Key” and the short key ID ``0x36879494``, so you cannot rely on "
"these alone. You also should not rely on any single website, not even over "
"HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"一旦您取得了 QMSK，您必須驗證它是真實的而非偽造的。任何人都可以建立一個名為"
"「Qubes Master Signing Key」且短金鑰 ID 為 ``0x36879494`` 的 PGP 金鑰，因此您"
"不能僅依賴這些。您也不應該依賴任何單一網站，即使是 HTTPS 也不行。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:109
#: 853289ff8f09425da30501174da9e53e
msgid ""
"So, what *should* you do? One option is to use the PGP `Web of Trust "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_of_trust>`__. In addition, some operating "
"systems include the means to acquire the QMSK securely. For example, on "
"Fedora, ``dnf install distribution-gpg-keys`` will get you the QMSK along "
"with several other Qubes keys. On Debian, your keyring may already contain "
"the necessary keys."
msgstr ""
"那麼，您*應該*怎麼做？一種選擇是使用 PGP `信任網絡 <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Web_of_trust>`__。此外，一些作業系統包含安全取得 QMSK 的方法。例如，在 "
"Fedora 上，``dnf install distribution-gpg-keys`` 將為您取得 QMSK 以及其他幾"
"個 Qubes 金鑰。在 Debian 上，您的金鑰環可能已包含必要的金鑰。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:111
#: 2c75258b36fb402085e4f579153dd2b0
msgid ""
"Perhaps the most common route is to rely on the key’s fingerprint, which is "
"a string of 40 alphanumeric characters, like this:"
msgstr ""
"也許最常見的方法是依賴金鑰的指紋，這是一個由 40 個字母數字字元組成的字串，像"
"這樣："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:119
#: 5759aaadcfad43a7a43a26dc6b129ec5
msgid ""
"Every PGP key has one of these fingerprints, which uniquely identifies it "
"among all PGP keys. (On the command line, you can view a key’s fingerprint "
"with the ``gpg2 --fingerprint <KEY_ID>`` command.) Therefore, if you know "
"the genuine QMSK fingerprint, then you always have an easy way to confirm "
"whether any purported copy of it is authentic, simply by comparing the "
"fingerprints."
msgstr ""
"每個 PGP 金鑰都有一個這樣的指紋，它在所有 PGP 金鑰中唯一地識別它。（在命令列"
"上，您可以使用 ``gpg2 --fingerprint <KEY_ID>`` 命令檢視金鑰的指紋。）因此，如"
"果您知道真實的 QMSK 指紋，那麼您總是有一種簡單的方法來確認任何聲稱的副本是否"
"真實，只需比較指紋即可。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:121
#: fa943780cb5b44b2bf94bc9cc1023796
msgid ""
"But how do you know which fingerprint is the real one? After all, :ref:`this "
"website could be compromised <introduction/faq:should i trust this website?"
">`, so the fingerprint you see here may not be genuine. That’s why we "
"strongly suggest obtaining the fingerprint from *multiple independent "
"sources in several different ways*, then comparing the strings of letters "
"and numbers to make sure they match."
msgstr ""
"但是您如何知道哪個指紋是真實的呢？畢竟，\\ :ref:`這個網站可能被入侵 "
"<introduction/faq:should i trust this website?>`\\ ，因此您在這裡看到的指紋可"
"能不是真實的。這就是為什麼我們強烈建議從\\ *多個獨立來源以多種不同方式*\\ 取"
"得指紋，然後比較字母和數字字串以確保它們匹配。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:123
#: b4eb96d97d9544c784b7473829eaac72
msgid ""
"For the purpose of convincing yourself that you know the authentic QMSK "
"fingerprint, spaces and capitalization don’t matter. In other words, all of "
"these fingerprints are considered the same:"
msgstr ""
"為了說服自己知道真實的 QMSK 指紋，空格和大小寫並不重要。換句話說，所有這些指"
"紋都被認為是相同的："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:134
#: cf96a1b58a1944a489fbd3fcf9f70758
msgid ""
"Instead, what matters is that *all* the characters are present in *exactly* "
"the same order. If even one character is different, the fingerprints should "
"not be considered the same. Even if two fingerprints have all the same "
"characters, if any of those characters are in a different order, sequence, "
"or position, then the fingerprints should not be considered the same."
msgstr ""
"相反地，重要的是\\ *所有*\\ 字元必須以\\ *完全*\\ 相同的順序出現。即使只有一"
"個字元不同，指紋就不應被認為是相同的。即使兩個指紋擁有所有相同的字元，如果任"
"何字元的順序、序列或位置不同，則指紋不應被認為是相同的。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:136
#: f6fc6b5210e94545ae977ea6a081bff0
msgid ""
"However, for the purpose of *searching for*, *looking up*, or *entering* "
"keys, spaces and capitalization can matter, depending on the software or "
"tool you’re using. You may need to try different variations (e.g., with and "
"without spaces). You may also sometimes see (or need to enter) the entire "
"fingerprint prefixed with ``0x``, as in:"
msgstr ""
"然而，在*搜尋*、*查詢*或*輸入*金鑰時，空格和大小寫可能會因您使用的軟體或工具"
"而有所不同。您可能需要嘗試不同的變體（例如有空格和無空格）。您有時也可能看到"
"（或需要輸入）帶有 ``0x`` 前綴的完整指紋，如下所示："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:145
#: 021b73842cd149278e0c9a84bd282f2b
msgid ""
"The ``0x`` prefix is sometimes used to indicate that the string following it "
"is a hexadecimal value, and some PGP-related tools may require this prefix. "
"Again, for the purpose of convincing yourself that you know the authentic "
"QMSK fingerprint, you may safely ignore the ``0x`` prefix, as it is not part "
"of the fingerprint. As long as the 40-character string after the ``0x`` "
"matches exactly, the fingerprint is considered the same. The ``0x`` prefix "
"only matters if the software or tool you’re using cares about it."
msgstr ""
"``0x`` 前綴有時用於表示其後的字串是十六進位值，某些 PGP 相關工具可能需要此前"
"綴。同樣地，為了說服自己知道真實的 QMSK 指紋，您可以安全地忽略 ``0x`` 前綴，"
"因為它不是指紋的一部分。只要 ``0x`` 之後的 40 個字元字串完全匹配，指紋就被認"
"為是相同的。``0x`` 前綴只有在您使用的軟體或工具關心它時才重要。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:147
#: 4e33debd64da44918f21465ac041c0fa
msgid ""
"The general idea of “comparing fingerprints” is to go out into the world "
"(whether digitally, physically, or both) and find other 40-character strings "
"purporting to be the QMSK fingerprint, then compare them to your own "
"purported QMSK fingerprint to ensure that the sequence of alphanumeric "
"characters is exactly the same (again, regardless of spaces or "
"capitalization). If any of the characters do not match or are not in the "
"same order, then at least one of the fingerprints is a forgery. Here are "
"some ideas to get you started:"
msgstr ""
"「比對指紋」的一般概念是到現實世界中（無論是數位、實體或兩者兼備）尋找其他聲"
"稱是 QMSK 指紋的 40 個字元字串，然後將它們與您自己聲稱的 QMSK 指紋進行比較，"
"以確保字母數字字元的序列完全相同（同樣，無論空格或大小寫）。如果任何字元不匹"
"配或順序不同，那麼至少其中一個指紋是偽造的。以下是一些幫助您入門的想法："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:149
#: c1d84c5ebcc44462a5a927b859aa90d9
msgid ""
"Check the fingerprint on various websites (e.g., `mailing lists <https://"
"groups.google.com/g/qubes-devel/c/RqR9WPxICwg/m/kaQwknZPDHkJ>`__, "
"`discussion forums <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/1441/9>`__, `social "
"<https://x.com/rootkovska/status/496976187491876864>`__ `media <https://www."
"reddit.com/r/Qubes/comments/5bme9n/fingerprint_verification/>`__, `personal "
"websites <https://andrewdavidwong.com/fingerprints.txt>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在各個網站上檢查指紋（例如 `郵寄清單 <https://groups.google.com/g/qubes-"
"devel/c/RqR9WPxICwg/m/kaQwknZPDHkJ>`__、`討論區 <https://forum.qubes-os.org/"
"t/1441/9>`__、`社群媒體 <https://x.com/rootkovska/"
"status/496976187491876864>`__ `社交平台 <https://www.reddit.com/r/Qubes/"
"comments/5bme9n/fingerprint_verification/>`__、`個人網站 <https://"
"andrewdavidwong.com/fingerprints.txt>`__）。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:151
#: 5281e97193f847e9ac2f2ea2fbf51ce9
msgid ""
"Check against PDFs, photographs, and videos in which the fingerprint appears "
"(e.g., `slides from a talk <https://hyperelliptic.org/PSC/slides/"
"psc2015_qubesos.pdf>`__, on a `T-shirt <https://x.com/legind/"
"status/813847907858337793/photo/2>`__, or in the `recording of a "
"presentation <https://youtu.be/S0TVw7U3MkE?t=2563>`__)."
msgstr ""
"針對出現指紋的 PDF、照片和影片進行檢查（例如 `演講投影片 <https://"
"hyperelliptic.org/PSC/slides/psc2015_qubesos.pdf>`__、在 `T恤上 <https://x."
"com/legind/status/813847907858337793/photo/2>`__ 或 `演講錄影 <https://youtu."
"be/S0TVw7U3MkE?t=2563>`__）。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:153
#: 3a08a6731455470a8396ca70ceffb833
msgid ""
"Ask people to post the fingerprint on various mailing lists, forums, and "
"chat rooms."
msgstr "請人們在各種郵寄清單、論壇和聊天室中發布指紋。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:155
#: ca1f84a1a05d4625a74ea81131a2f06f
msgid ""
"Download old Qubes ISOs from different sources and check the included Qubes "
"Master Signing Key."
msgstr ""
"從不同來源下載舊版 Qubes ISO 並檢查其中包含的 Qubes Master Signing Key。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:157
#: 31feac1dcc484c4ba9e83ab6afbcc8c6
msgid "Repeat the above over Tor."
msgstr "透過 Tor 重複上述操作。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:159
#: 5dd4d047c6e34e0da97f524bc5e8ecad
msgid "Repeat the above over various VPNs and proxy servers."
msgstr "透過各種 VPN 和代理伺服器重複上述操作。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:161
#: 19cc843ad71348d7845b80035889985e
msgid ""
"Repeat the above on different networks (work, school, internet cafe, etc.)."
msgstr "在不同網路（工作、學校、網咖等）上重複上述操作。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:163
#: 93589da386ca4a7d9523fff1418d7990
msgid ""
"Text, email, call, video chat, snail mail, or meet up with people you know "
"to confirm the fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"透過簡訊、電子郵件、通話、視訊聊天、傳統郵件或與您認識的人會面來確認指紋。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:165
#: 6da3bdd6ab32422b9c0a4cfe9fa8dc4c
msgid "Repeat the above from different computers and devices."
msgstr "從不同的電腦和裝置重複上述操作。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:169
#: a83d35e69bc146d980314803c93fcd1b
msgid ""
"Once you’ve observed enough matching fingerprints from enough independent "
"sources in enough different ways that you feel confident that you have the "
"genuine fingerprint, keep it in a safe place. Every time you need to check "
"whether a key claiming to be the QMSK is authentic, compare that key’s "
"fingerprint to your trusted copy and confirm they match."
msgstr ""
"一旦您從足夠多的獨立來源以足夠多的不同方式觀察到足夠多的匹配指紋，並確信您擁"
"有真實的指紋，請將其保存在安全的地方。每次您需要檢查聲稱是 QMSK 的金鑰是否真"
"實時，請將該金鑰的指紋與您信任的副本進行比較，並確認它們匹配。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:171
#: 12fb3f9998cf4df1901751b47d42927f
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve imported the authentic QMSK, set its trust level to "
"“ultimate” so that it can be used to automatically verify all the keys "
"signed by the QMSK (in particular, RSKs)."
msgstr ""
"既然您已匯入真實的 QMSK，請將其信任等級設定為「ultimate」，以便它可以用來自動"
"驗證所有由 QMSK 簽署的金鑰（特別是 RSK）。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:215
#: bac1555f9d2f4daab57197869144e340
msgid ""
"Now, when you import any of the release signing keys and many Qubes team "
"member keys, they will already be trusted in virtue of being signed by the "
"QMSK."
msgstr ""
"現在，當您匯入任何發布簽署金鑰和許多 Qubes 團隊成員金鑰時，它們將因為由 QMSK "
"簽署而已經受到信任。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:217
#: f5bedae0d5d9409698e6e460afbb3b38
msgid ""
"As a final sanity check, make sure the QMSK is in your keyring with the "
"correct trust level."
msgstr "作為最終的合理性檢查，請確保 QMSK 在您的金鑰環中具有正確的信任等級。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:229
#: 25d3d77816e648bb8547f5d20ce3634a
msgid ""
"If you don’t see the QMSK here with a trust level of “ultimate,” go back and "
"follow the instructions in this section carefully and consult the :ref:"
"`project-security/verifying-signatures:troubleshooting faq` below."
msgstr ""
"如果您在這裡沒有看到信任等級為「ultimate」的 QMSK，請返回並仔細遵循本節中的說"
"明，並查閱下面的 :ref:`project-security/verifying-signatures:troubleshooting "
"faq`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:234
#: 4b8714d06316448c8b809025fa3357ec
msgid "How to import and authenticate release signing keys"
msgstr "如何匯入和驗證發布簽署金鑰"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:237
#: 4045b34a6a064c5092266921d7e610ac
msgid ""
"Every Qubes OS release is signed by a **release signing key (RSK)**, which "
"is, in turn, signed by the Qubes Master Signing Key (QMSK)."
msgstr ""
"每個 Qubes OS 發布版本都由一個**發布簽署金鑰 (RSK)** 簽署，而該金鑰又由 "
"Qubes Master Signing Key (QMSK) 簽署。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:241
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:319
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:410
#: 73667abea6844ef8baf1213440415c77 a48db10da8914e0196b53f4302f618cb
#: 3aec2bde1a024c62bf62714001189a1a
msgid ""
"Before we proceed, you must first complete the following prerequisite steps:"
msgstr "在繼續之前，您必須先完成以下先決步驟："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:243
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:321
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:412
#: 479e8162dc5745cabf07c7b30f3d037a 1635a78f4aab4190b00ad52c8275bf32
#: 7f1ea2df8430481b8200d5b34d5aac40
msgid ""
":ref:`Install OpenPGP software. <project-security/verifying-signatures:"
"openpgp software>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 OpenPGP 軟體。 <project-security/verifying-signatures:openpgp "
"software>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:245
#: 516cbbabce894e69bd881467f9113045
msgid ":ref:`Import and authenticate the QMSK. <how-to-import-QMSK>`"
msgstr ":ref:`匯入和驗證 QMSK。 <how-to-import-QMSK>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:249
#: a3224b1e89964f5eb3a9589698e45e38
msgid ""
"After you have completed these two prerequisite steps, the next step is to "
"obtain the correct RSK. The filename pattern for RSKs is :file:`qubes-"
"release-{*}-signing-key.asc`, where :samp:`{*}` is either a major or minor "
"Qubes release number, such as :samp:`4` or :samp:`4.3`. There are several "
"ways to get the RSK for your Qubes release."
msgstr ""
"完成這兩個先決步驟後，下一步是取得正確的 RSK。RSK 的檔名模式為 :file:`qubes-"
"release-{*}-signing-key.asc`，其中 :samp:`{*}` 是 Qubes 的主要或次要版本號，"
"例如 :samp:`4` 或 :samp:`4.3`。有幾種方法可以取得您 Qubes 版本的 RSK。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:251
#: 7fe591c53acf472a9e068d4c0dc5ee88
msgid ""
"**If you have access to an existing Qubes installation**, the release keys "
"are available **in dom0** or **in the official Fedora templates** (and qubes "
"based on them), in :file:`/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-qubes-{*}`."
msgstr ""
"**如果您可以存取現有的 Qubes 安裝**，發布金鑰可在 **dom0 中**或**官方 Fedora "
"範本中**（以及基於它們的 qube 中）取得，位於 :file:`/etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-"
"KEY-qubes-{*}`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:253
#: a28dbf7fba854160b87223142b048ec7
msgid ""
"These can be :doc:`copied from dom0 </user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-from-"
"dom0>` or :doc:`any qube based on fedora </user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-"
"and-move-files>` into other qubes for further use."
msgstr ""
"這些可以 :doc:`從 dom0 複製 </user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-from-dom0>` 或 :"
"doc:`從任何基於 fedora 的 qube </user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-and-move-"
"files>` 複製到其他 qube 中以供進一步使用。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:255
#: daf10719e30d455d9edd24742dbe204b
msgid ""
"If you wish to use one of these keys, **make sure to import it into your "
"keyring**, e.g.:"
msgstr "如果您希望使用其中一個金鑰，**請確保將其匯入您的金鑰環**，例如："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:262
#: 4f3eb60e4af543d7b1ae5b8ca516e6db
msgid "**Fetch it with GPG**:"
msgstr "**使用 GPG 取得它**："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:269
#: 9af241c3690642259f46941c618448a2
msgid ""
"**Download it as a file**. You can find the RSK for your Qubes release on "
"the `downloads <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ page. You can also "
"download all the currently used developers’ signing keys, RSKs, and the "
"Qubes Master Signing Key from the :doc:`Qubes security pack </project-"
"security/security-pack>` and the `Qubes keyserver <https://keys.qubes-os.org/"
"keys/>`__. Once you’ve downloaded your RSK, **import it with GPG**:"
msgstr ""
"**以檔案形式下載**。您可以在`下載頁面 <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/"
">`__ 上找到您 Qubes 版本的 RSK。您也可以從 :doc:`Qubes 安全包 </project-"
"security/security-pack>` 和 `Qubes keyserver <https://keys.qubes-os.org/keys/"
">`__ 下載所有目前使用的開發者簽署金鑰、RSK 和 Qubes Master Signing Key。下載 "
"RSK 後，**使用 GPG 匯入它**："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:278
#: a6cefbd6ffd446788528a0337db01225
msgid ""
"Now that you have the correct RSK, you simply need to verify that it is "
"signed by the QMSK:"
msgstr "既然您有了正確的 RSK，您只需要驗證它是由 QMSK 簽署的："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:293
#: 3f443716155e4c22b6852053bf733fbf
msgid ""
"This is just an example, so the output you receive may not look exactly the "
"same (:samp:`{X}` will be replaced by the release number). What matters is "
"the line with a ``sig!`` prefix showing that the QMSK has signed this key. "
"This verifies the authenticity of the RSK. Note that the ``!`` flag after "
"the ``sig`` tag is important because it means that the key signature is "
"valid. A ``sig-`` prefix would indicate a bad signature, and ``sig%`` would "
"mean that gpg encountered an error while verifying the signature. It is not "
"necessary to independently verify the authenticity of the RSK, since you "
"already verified the authenticity of the QMSK."
msgstr ""
"這只是一個範例，因此您收到的輸出可能不完全相同（:samp:`{X}` 將被版本號取"
"代）。重要的是帶有 ``sig!`` 前綴的行，顯示 QMSK 已簽署此金鑰。這驗證了 RSK 的"
"真實性。請注意，``sig`` 標籤後的 ``!`` 標誌很重要，因為它表示金鑰簽章是有效"
"的。``sig-`` 前綴將表示簽章錯誤，而 ``sig%`` 則表示 gpg 在驗證簽章時遇到錯"
"誤。您不需要獨立驗證 RSK 的真實性，因為您已經驗證了 QMSK 的真實性。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:295
#: 3598a9e236084f3cb460a32643c2dc8f
msgid ""
"As a final sanity check, make sure the RSK is in your keyring with the "
"correct trust level:"
msgstr "作為最終的合理性檢查，請確保 RSK 在您的金鑰環中具有正確的信任等級："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:306
#: 9bb4a14a08c8486483f7a180fd2a6921
msgid ""
"If you don’t see the correct RSK here with a trust level of “full” or "
"higher, go back and follow the instructions in this section carefully, and "
"consult the :ref:`project-security/verifying-signatures:troubleshooting faq` "
"below."
msgstr ""
"如果您在這裡沒有看到具有「full」或更高信任等級的正確 RSK，請返回並仔細遵循本"
"節中的說明，並查閱下面的 :ref:`project-security/verifying-signatures:"
"troubleshooting faq`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:309
#: 626757314b434384a9e5bdb753eef72c
msgid "How to obtain and authenticate other signing keys"
msgstr "如何取得和驗證其他簽署金鑰"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:312
#: 3e16f705e0e745fd80ad73fd46a5db18
msgid ""
"Please see the :doc:`Qubes security pack </project-security/security-pack>` "
"documentation."
msgstr "請參閱 :doc:`Qubes 安全包 </project-security/security-pack>` 文件。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:315
#: e57a92a59b314caeb726d3235c1f7d64
msgid "How to verify detached PGP signatures on Qubes ISOs"
msgstr "如何驗證 Qubes ISO 上的分離式 PGP 簽章"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:323
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:414
#: 95ea74b69d4d4d8a8c51a0ee476a5d2c 76b6e11d42c8404da13da276470c0ec6
msgid ""
":ref:`Import and authenticate the Qubes Master Signing Key. <how-to-import-"
"QMSK>`"
msgstr ":ref:`匯入和驗證 Qubes Master Signing Key。 <how-to-import-QMSK>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:325
#: 6660b6788836492281cdfb6f86ecdc69
msgid ""
":ref:`Import and authenticate your release signing key. <how-to-import-RSK>`"
msgstr ":ref:`匯入和驗證您的發布簽署金鑰。 <how-to-import-RSK>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:329
#: f7a07d755c74441c9fa26b05cd29b9d8
msgid ""
"Every Qubes ISO is released with a **detached PGP signature** file, which "
"you can find on the `downloads <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ page "
"alongside the ISO. If the filename of your ISO is :file:`Qubes-R{X}-86_64."
"iso`, then the name of the signature file for that ISO is :file:`Qubes-"
"R{X}-86_64.iso.asc`, where :samp:`{X}` is a specific release of Qubes. The "
"signature filename is always the same as the ISO filename followed by ``."
"asc``."
msgstr ""
"每個 Qubes ISO 都附帶一個**分離式 PGP 簽章**檔案，您可以在`下載頁面 <https://"
"www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__ 上與 ISO 一起找到。如果您 ISO 的檔名是 :file:"
"`Qubes-R{X}-86_64.iso`，則該 ISO 的簽章檔名為 :file:`Qubes-R{X}-86_64.iso."
"asc`，其中 :samp:`{X}` 是特定的 Qubes 版本。簽章檔名始終與 ISO 檔名相同，後"
"接 ``.asc``。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:331
#: f92850c2b3b646c4914cad56f7abfd89
msgid ""
"**Download both the ISO and its signature file**. Put both of them **in the "
"same directory**, then navigate to that directory. Now, you can verify the "
"ISO by executing this GPG command in the directory that contains both files, "
"make sure to replace :samp:`Qubes-R{X}` by the correct release number (i."
"e.: :samp:`Qubes-R{4.3}`):"
msgstr ""
"**下載 ISO 和其簽章檔案**。將它們都放在**同一個目錄**中，然後導航到該目錄。現"
"在，您可以在包含這兩個檔案的目錄中執行此 GPG 命令來驗證 ISO，請確保將 :samp:"
"`Qubes-R{X}` 替換為正確的版本號（例如 :samp:`Qubes-R{4.3}`）："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:344
#: 44f3b0baec544719983386b5ec1a03ba
msgid ""
"This is just an example, so the output you receive will not look exactly the "
"same. What matters is the line that says ``Good signature from \"Qubes OS "
"Release X Signing Key\"``. This confirms that the signature on the ISO is "
"good."
msgstr ""
"這只是一個範例，因此您收到的輸出不會完全相同。重要的是顯示 ``Good signature "
"from \"Qubes OS Release X Signing Key\"`` 的那一行。這確認了 ISO 上的簽章是有"
"效的。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:346
#: e27e59f79a924ad8b5fb335b25d47e1d
msgid ""
"If you don’t see a good signature here, go back and follow the instructions "
"in this section carefully, and consult the :ref:`project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:troubleshooting faq` below."
msgstr ""
"如果您在這裡沒有看到有效的簽章，請返回並仔細遵循本節中的說明，並查閱下面的 :"
"ref:`project-security/verifying-signatures:troubleshooting faq`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:349
#: b45e89436a564a80a306ea91efb824f5
msgid "How to re-verify installation media after writing"
msgstr "如何重新驗證寫入後的安裝媒體"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:351
#: 12c3807292da45879bd8bf553334f8ac
msgid "This is an optional section intended for advanced users."
msgstr "這是一個可選章節，適用於進階使用者。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:353
#: e98340251995418b94bb96941b484f71
msgid ""
"**Why would you want to re-verify the data that has been written when you’ve "
"already verified the original ISO?** Well, it’s conceivable that a "
"sufficiently sophisticated adversary might allow your initial ISO "
"verification to succeed (so as not to alert you that your machine has been "
"compromised, for example), then surreptitiously modify the data as it is "
"being written onto your installation medium, resulting in a compromised "
"Qubes installer. This might increase the odds that the attack goes "
"undetected. One way to mitigate this risk is to re-verify the installer "
"after writing it onto an installation medium that cannot be altered, such as "
"a USB drive with a properly implemented physical write-protect switch and "
"firmware that is either unflashable or cryptographically signed (or both), "
"as discussed in our :doc:`installation security considerations </user/"
"downloading-installing-upgrading/install-security>`."
msgstr ""
"**為什麼在已經驗證原始 ISO 之後還要重新驗證已寫入的資料？** 可以想像，一個足"
"夠老練的對手可能會讓您的初始 ISO 驗證成功（例如以免警覺到您的機器已被入侵），"
"然後在資料寫入安裝媒體時暗中修改資料，導致 Qubes 安裝程式被入侵。這可能會增加"
"攻擊不被檢測到的機率。減輕此風險的一種方法是在將安裝程式寫入無法更改的安裝媒"
"體（例如具有正確實作物理寫入保護開關和不可刷新或經加密簽章（或兩者兼備）的韌"
"體的 USB 隨身碟）後重新驗證，如我們的 :doc:`安裝安全考量 </user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/install-security>` 中所述。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:355
#: 29b9c07d45db420b93cebcbcd3fe62c9
msgid "Before we proceed, you must have:"
msgstr "在繼續之前，您必須具備："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:357
#: f872a1c11c454ada8ae903853d145446
msgid ":ref:`an authentic RSK <how-to-import-RSK>`"
msgstr ":ref:`一個真實的 RSK <how-to-import-RSK>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:358
#: 839edb0c713144ef832c1a5681e936ae
msgid ""
":ref:`written a Qubes ISO onto your desired medium <user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/installation-guide:copying the iso onto the "
"installation medium>` (such as a USB drive or optical disc)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`將 Qubes ISO 寫入您想要的媒體 <user/downloading-installing-upgrading/"
"installation-guide:copying the iso onto the installation medium>`（例如 USB "
"隨身碟或光碟）"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:360
#: 0f364033988d453aac590e8c56258261
msgid ""
"**First**, unplug your USB drive and flip the write protect switch so that "
"the data on the drive can no longer be altered."
msgstr ""
"**首先**，拔下您的 USB 隨身碟並撥動寫入保護開關，使隨身碟上的資料無法再被更"
"改。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:362
#: dde0636230ce43efb2ea670405d16953
msgid "Then, you have two options:"
msgstr "然後，您有兩個選項："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:364
#: 7a30be0fce1d41ffb13139cff2ed1dbb
msgid ""
"**If you have a different computer** from the one you used to create the "
"installation medium, consider using that computer, preferably an offline "
"computer that has never seen the original ISO."
msgstr ""
"**如果您有與建立安裝媒體不同的電腦**，請考慮使用該電腦，最好是從未見過原始 "
"ISO 的離線電腦。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:365
#: 13cc4c26701a43fe8772ce7a3713e2b1
msgid ""
"**If not**, try to at least use a fresh VM (e.g., a new qube if it’s a Qubes "
"system), preferably offline and with a storage space that is too small to "
"hold the original ISO"
msgstr ""
"**如果沒有**\\ ，請至少嘗試使用一個全新的 VM（例如如果是 Qubes 系統則使用新"
"的 qube），最好是離線的，且儲存空間小到無法容納原始 ISO。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:367
#: 7589870e3cb44168aeb94be8d0f80526
msgid ""
"The idea is that the original system may have been compromised, and using a "
"different one for re-verification forces your hypothetical adversary to "
"compromise an additional system in order to succeed. After all, if your "
"adversary knows the answer you’re looking for — namely, a match to the "
"genuine ISO — and has access to that very ISO in the same re-verification "
"environment, then there is little to prevent them from simply reading the "
"original ISO and feeding you that result (perhaps while also reading from "
"the USB drive and piping it into ``/dev/null`` so that you see the light on "
"the USB drive blinking to support the illusion that the data is being read "
"from the USB drive)."
msgstr ""
"其概念是原始系統可能已被入侵，而使用不同的系統進行重新驗證迫使您的假想對手必"
"須再入侵另一個系統才能成功。畢竟，如果您的對手知道您正在尋找的答案——也就是與"
"真實 ISO 匹配——並且可以在同一個重新驗證環境中存取該 ISO，那麼幾乎沒有什麼可以"
"阻止他們直接讀取原始 ISO 並將該結果提供給您（可能同時從 USB 隨身碟讀取資料並"
"將其導入 ``/dev/null``，讓您看到 USB 隨身碟上的燈閃爍，以營造正在從 USB 隨身"
"碟讀取資料的假象）。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:369
#: f203b5ccec3842df845717fde6a79188
msgid ""
"Now, our goal is to perform **the same verification steps as we did with the "
"original ISO**, except, this time, we’ll be reading the installer data "
"directly from the write-protected USB drive instead of from the original ISO "
"file."
msgstr ""
"現在，我們的目標是執行**與原始 ISO 相同的驗證步驟**，但這次我們將直接從已寫入"
"保護的 USB 隨身碟讀取安裝程式資料，而不是從原始 ISO 檔案。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:371
#: 1ff7b74faa1947b9a27aaa3d34d8d081
msgid ""
"In order to do this, **we have to know the exact size, in bytes, of the "
"original ISO**. There are two ways to get this information:"
msgstr ""
"為了做到這一點，**我們必須知道原始 ISO 的準確大小（以位元組為單位）**。有兩種"
"方法可以取得此資訊："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:373
#: bdb051ecba8c49a2a9f68a650bed0cf5
msgid ""
"**from the Qubes website**, by hovering over any ISO download button on the "
"`downloads page <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/>`__. You can also view "
"these values directly in the `downloads page’s source data <https://github."
"com/QubesOS/qubesos.github.io/blob/master/_data/downloads.yml>`__."
msgstr ""
"**從 Qubes 網站**，將滑鼠懸停在`下載頁面 <https://www.qubes-os.org/downloads/"
">`__ 上的任何 ISO 下載按鈕上。您也可以直接在`下載頁面的原始資料 <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/qubesos.github.io/blob/master/_data/downloads.yml>`__ 中檢"
"視這些值。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:374
#: e36d494123f74810955da6b7a77b607c
msgid "**from the ISO itself**:"
msgstr "**從 ISO 本身**\\ ："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:381
#: 69f3577f002b4a3e9d4f531b412c9c2a
msgid ""
"Where :file:`Qubes-R{X}-x86_64.iso` is your Qubes ISO (with :samp:`{X}` "
"replaced by the release number). Note that your actual byte number will "
"depend on which Qubes ISO you’re using. This is just an example."
msgstr ""
"其中 :file:`Qubes-R{X}-x86_64.iso` 是您的 Qubes ISO（:samp:`{X}` 被版本號取"
"代）。請注意，您實際的位元組數將取決於您使用的 Qubes ISO。這只是一個範例。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:383
#: 2df7e3d2adf44bd88fc198b2359e11eb
msgid ""
"You can now use :program:`gpg` to verify the detached PGP signature directly "
"against the data on the USB drive. The following command reads the exact "
"number of bytes from your USB drive and pipes them into :program:`gpg`:"
msgstr ""
"您現在可以使用 :program:`gpg` 直接針對 USB 隨身碟上的資料驗證分離式 PGP 簽"
"章。以下命令從您的 USB 隨身碟讀取精確的位元組數，並將它們透過管道傳入 :"
"program:`gpg`："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:398
#: 26ed2787dd364d37b06dd90dd06ccb1a
msgid ""
"Where :file:`/dev/{sdX}` is your USB drive, :samp:`<SIZE>` is the exact size "
"in bytes of the original ISO and ``Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso.asc`` is the detached "
"PGP signature file of the original ISO."
msgstr ""
"其中 :file:`/dev/{sdX}` 是您的 USB 隨身碟，:samp:`<SIZE>` 是原始 ISO 的準確大"
"小（以位元組為單位），``Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso.asc`` 是原始 ISO 的分離式 PGP 簽"
"章檔案。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:400
#: dff820679bdc475e8993535e1e78c99a
msgid ""
"The usual form of a :program:`gpg` verification command is ``gpg --verify "
"<SIGNATURE> <SIGNED_DATA>``. Our command is using shell redirection in order "
"to use data from your USB drive as the ``<SIGNED_DATA>``, which is why the "
"``-`` at the end of the command is required."
msgstr ""
":program:`gpg` 驗證命令的通常形式是 ``gpg --verify <簽章> <簽署資料>``。我們"
"的命令使用 shell 重新導向，以便將來自 USB 隨身碟的資料用作 ``<簽署資料>``，這"
"就是為什麼命令末尾需要 ``-`` 的原因。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:403
#: 6826c726739343fc85cfdcb3aef807f2
msgid ""
"**The output you receive will not look exactly the same**, what matters is "
"that you should receive a ``Good signature`` message for the :ref:"
"`appropriate RSK <how-to-import-RSK>`, which should be signed by a copy of "
"the :ref:`genuine QMSK <how-to-import-QMSK>`."
msgstr ""
"**您收到的輸出不會完全相同**，重要的是您應該收到一個針對 :ref:`適當的 RSK "
"<how-to-import-RSK>` 的 ``Good signature`` 訊息，而該 RSK 應由 :ref:`真實 "
"QMSK <how-to-import-QMSK>` 的副本簽署。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:406
#: f942d7394a06457093c2ae5df095f3cd
msgid "How to verify signatures on Git repository tags and commits"
msgstr "如何驗證 Git 儲存庫標籤和送交上的簽章"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:416
#: bf35ab1d03b74354b3827aca3ad2153e
msgid ""
":doc:`Import and authenticate keys from the Qubes security pack (qubes-"
"secpack). </project-security/security-pack>` Please see our :ref:`PGP key "
"policies <project-security/security-pack:pgp key policies>` for important "
"information about these keys."
msgstr ""
":doc:`從 Qubes 安全包 (qubes-secpack) 匯入和驗證金鑰。 </project-security/"
"security-pack>` 請參閱我們的 :ref:`PGP 金鑰政策 <project-security/security-"
"pack:pgp key policies>` 以了解關於這些金鑰的重要資訊。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:420
#: 76437ff1b494461d98ce3ba3731f574a
msgid ""
"Whenever you use one of the `Qubes repositories <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS>`__, you should use Git to verify the PGP signature in a tag on the "
"latest commit or on the latest commit itself. (One or both may be present, "
"but only one is required.) If there is no trusted signed tag or commit on "
"top, any commits after the latest trusted signed tag or commit should "
"**not** be trusted. If you come across a repo with any unsigned commits, you "
"should not add any of your own signed tags or commits on top of them unless "
"you personally vouch for the trustworthiness of the unsigned commits. "
"Instead, ask the person who pushed the unsigned commits to sign them."
msgstr ""
"每當您使用任何 `Qubes 儲存庫 <https://github.com/QubesOS>`__\\ 時，您應該使"
"用 Git 驗證最新送交上的標籤或最新送交本身的 PGP 簽章。（可能兩者都存在，但只"
"需要一個。）如果頂端沒有可信任的已簽署標籤或送交，則最新可信任已簽署標籤或送"
"交之後的任何送交都\\ **不應**\\ 被信任。如果您遇到包含任何未簽署送交的儲存"
"庫，您不應在其之上添加任何自己的已簽署標籤或送交，除非您個人擔保這些未簽署送"
"交的可信度。相反地，請要求推送未簽署送交的人對它們進行簽署。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:422
#: fb0c21c7ed044e79a007330865c0ad66
msgid ""
"You should always perform this verification on a trusted local machine with "
"properly authenticated keys rather than relying on a third party, such as "
"GitHub. While the GitHub interface may claim that a commit has a verified "
"signature from a member of the Qubes team, this is only trustworthy if "
"GitHub has performed the signature check correctly, the account identity is "
"authentic, an admin has not replaced the user’s key, GitHub’s servers have "
"not been compromised, and so on. Since there’s no way for you to be certain "
"that all such conditions hold, you’re much better off verifying signatures "
"yourself. (Also see: :ref:`distrusting the infrastructure <introduction/faq:"
"what does it mean to \"distrust the infrastructure\"?>`.)"
msgstr ""
"GitHub 正確執行了簽章檢查、帳戶身份是真實的、管理員未更換使用者的金鑰、"
"GitHub 的伺服器未被入侵等。由於您無法確定所有這些條件都成立，因此最好自己驗證"
"簽章。（另請參閱：:ref:`distrusting the infrastructure <introduction/faq:"
"what does it mean to \"distrust the infrastructure\"?>`。）"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:425
#: 7bf29535f5d842f6ab6ab0287519211d
msgid "How to verify a signature on a Git tag"
msgstr "如何驗證 Git 標籤上的簽章"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:433
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:449
#: 62e4901f1c9f4514847612076d7ba0b4 7547909b155346ae8ca6e938ef9bcd9f
msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:441
#: 6637339e146e47ccb6a71e741cc2b362
msgid "How to verify a signature on a Git commit"
msgstr "如何驗證 Git 送交上的簽章"

