msgstr "疑難排解常見問題"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:461
#: 860af71960bf4f8dac1fda35a364822c
msgid "Why am I getting \"Can't check signature: public key not found\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「Can't check signature: public key not found」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:464
#: 65f7a9504f3c4a59b8860d0dc2a5630f
msgid ""
"You don’t have the correct :ref:`release signing key <how-to-import-RSK>`."
msgstr "您沒有正確的\\ :ref:`發佈簽署金鑰 <how-to-import-RSK>`\\ 。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:467
#: e37dbc2573dc4be799984dedf0173319
msgid ""
"Why am I getting \"BAD signature from ‘Qubes OS Release X Signing Key'\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「BAD signature from 'Qubes OS Release X Signing Key'」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:470
#: 28ba076905d14ff391d9a65d5f28a4ff
msgid "The problem could be one or more of the following:"
msgstr "問題可能是以下一項或多項："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:472
#: 1368c98d3d254fa884d2d9923f6510ed
msgid "You’re trying to verify the wrong file(s). Reread this page carefully."
msgstr "您正在嘗試驗證錯誤的檔案。仔細重新閱讀此頁面。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:474
#: 57ca30fb87cc47398bc2536a093b0e23
msgid ""
"You’re using the wrong GPG command. Follow the provided examples carefully, "
"or try using ``gpg`` instead of ``gpg2`` (or vice versa)."
msgstr ""
"您使用了錯誤的 GPG 命令。仔細遵循提供的範例，或嘗試使用 ``gpg`` 代替 ``gpg2``"
"（反之亦然）。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:476
#: 48a17bd2b7834dce838d77a7850735dd
msgid ""
"The ISO or :ref:`detached PGP signature file <project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>` is bad (e."
"g., incomplete or corrupt download). Try downloading the signature file "
"again from a different source, then try verifying again. If you still get "
"the same result, try downloading the ISO again from a different source, then "
"try verifying again."
msgstr ""
"ISO 或 :ref:`分離式 PGP 簽章檔案 <project-security/verifying-signatures:how "
"to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>` 有問題（例如下載不完整或損"
"毀）。請嘗試從其他來源重新下載簽章檔案，然後再次嘗試驗證。如果仍然得到相同的"
"結果，請嘗試從其他來源重新下載 ISO，然後再次嘗試驗證。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:481
#: 742af3f7172a447c901a114e8a377544
msgid "Why am I getting \"bash: gpg2: command not found\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「bash: gpg2: command not found」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:484
#: 57a1b19a89374642ba86704d5a8f53ef
msgid ""
"You don’t have ``gpg2`` installed. Please install it using the method "
"appropriate for your environment (e.g., via your package manager), or try "
"using ``gpg`` instead."
msgstr ""
"您尚未安裝 ``gpg2``。請使用適合您環境的方法（例如透過套件管理器）安裝它，或嘗"
"試使用 ``gpg`` 代替。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:487
#: 677210e92ec045dab726d468e649832b
