msgstr ""
"您驗證的對象不是正確的 :ref:`獨立 PGP 簽章檔案 <project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:543
#: a3c47b274267420da67ee047b4af4e8e
msgid "Why am I getting \"not a detached signature\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「not a detached signature」？"

