msgid "Why am I getting \"CRC error; […] no signature found […]\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「CRC error; […] no signature found […]」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:552
#: 865243d1b913415ca481c17c70560444
msgid ""
"You’re not verifying against the correct :ref:`detached PGP signature file "
"<project-security/verifying-signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures "
"on qubes isos>`, or the signature file has been modified. Try downloading it "
"again or from a different source."
msgstr ""
"您驗證的對象不是正確的 :ref:`獨立 PGP 簽章檔案 <project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>`，或者簽章檔"
"案已被修改。請嘗試重新下載或從其他來源下載。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:555
